Description: Proxmox PBS Disaster Recovery Orchestration
 Automated disaster recovery orchestration for Proxmox Backup Server.
 Provides async backup verification, state machine DR workflow,
 multi-environment configuration, and Prometheus metrics export.
 .
 Features:
  - Async/parallel backup verification
  - DR state machine with automatic failover
  - Workflow DAG for multi-node recovery
  - Prometheus metrics and alerting
